{"id":"n56433-1-6","stage":3,"title":"바닷물 · 海水","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56433-1-6-1","ko":"주말에 뭘 했어요?","zh":"周末你做了什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"했어요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어요","audio":"/audio/767a8404e5a0794daaf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/89d1463e451d0e5f6aa9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56433-1-6-2","ko":"바닷가에 갔다 왔는데 아직 바닷물이 차가워서 해수욕은 못 했어요.","zh":"我去了海边，不过海水还太冷，所以没去游泳。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바닷가에","meaning":"海边，海滨","explanation":"바닷가：海边，海滨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닷가","audio":"/audio/edee03fff87eddb66cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56428","senseId":"1","lemma":"바닷가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닷가에","audio":"/audio/44706357433e8b22f7b0.mp3"}},{"text":"갔다","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔다","audio":"/audio/fd82f61af73f8e8a4df4.mp3"}},{"text":"왔는데","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔는데","audio":"/audio/00521fca05afdb9d28ff.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"바닷물이","meaning":"海水","explanation":"바닷물：海水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바닷물","audio":"/audio/fd0c08ddc6d8bbd3ab91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56433","senseId":"1","lemma":"바닷물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닷물이","audio":"/audio/bb5dfe3e729943d63e5d.mp3"}},{"text":"차가워서","meaning":"凉，冰凉","explanation":"차갑다：凉，冰凉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"차갑다","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71730","senseId":"1","lemma":"차갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차가워서","audio":"/audio/326254fec9eb6d5bac60.mp3"}},{"text":"해수욕은","meaning":"海水浴","explanation":"해수욕：海水浴；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"해수욕","audio":"/audio/e78fd63fb26b57ead13e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85713","senseI